Scoped IFF (Interchange File Format) MAUD demuxer

The FORM...MAUD probe, the chunk walk to EOF with odd-size padding, the
MHDR fields (bits, rate numerator/denominator, channels, compression),
the MDAT body range, the CHAN layout override, the metadata chunk ids,
the MAUD codec table and the min(body_end - pos, 1024 * block_align)
packet size in src/iff.ts follow libavformat/iff.c (iff_probe,
iff_read_header, iff_read_packet audio-only branch).
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
